OL,3,GNEWSATwo hospitals at risk of losing
OL,4,Amaternity units
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo hospitals could lose their
OL,7,Fmaternity units under proposals being
OL,8,Fconsidered by the NHS trust that runs
OL,9,Fthem.
OL,11,FThe Norfolk and Waveney University
OL,12,FHospitals Group said it was considering
OL,13,Fclosing delivery suites at either the
OL,14,FJames Paget University Hospital or the
OL,15,FQueen Elizabeth Hospital, or moving all
OL,16,Fbirths to the Norfolk and Norwich
OL,17,FUniversity Hospital.
OL,19,FRachael Cocker, the trust's chief
OL,20,Fnurse, said the number of births across
OL,21,Fthe three hospitals was expected to
OL,22,Ffall by between 9% and 13% by 2031/32.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
