OL,3,GNEWSATwo hospitals at risk of losing
OL,4,Amaternity units
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe proposals were presented at an
OL,7,Fextraordinary meeting earlier and the
OL,8,Ftrust's leaders said no decisions had
OL,9,Fbeen taken and the public would be
OL,10,Fconsulted before any changes were made.
